      "diff": "@@ -297,6 +297,7 @@ UDP Tracker Protocol for BitTorrent (BT-Tracker)\n UWB UCI Protocol\n Video Protocol 9 (VP9)\n Windows Delivery Optimization (MS-DO)\n+VMware HeartBeat\n Z21 LAN Protocol (Z21)\n Zabbix\n Zigbee TLV\n",
